{
 "title": "方法和 impl",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "想给一个类型添加行为，就写一个 **`impl`** 块。方法的第一个参数是 `self`；通过 `self.字段` 访问对象的字段。调用形如 `对象.方法()`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Rectangle:",
    "    width: f64",
    "    height: f64",
    "",
    "impl Rectangle:",
    "    fn area(self) -> f64:",
    "        return self.width * self.height",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    rect = Rectangle{ width: 10.0, height: 5.0 }",
    "    print(\"Area:\", rect.area())"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Area: 50"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "就地修改对象的方法写成 `self: lend 类型`（`lend` 会在第 5 章学到：“借用并修改”）。不带 `self` 的方法是**静态**方法，常用作构造函数：`类型.名字(...)`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Player:",
    "    name: str",
    "    health: i32",
    "",
    "impl Player:",
    "    fn new(name: str) -> Player:",
    "        return Player{ name: name, health: 100 }",
    "",
    "    fn is_alive(self) -> bool:",
    "        return self.health > 0",
    "",
    "    fn take_damage(self: lend Player, amount: i32):",
    "        self.health -= amount",
    "        if self.health < 0:",
    "            self.health = 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    hero = Player.new(\"Aragorn\")",
    "    hero.take_damage(35)",
    "    print(\"Health:\", hero.health)",
    "    print(\"Alive?\", hero.is_alive())"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Health: 65",
    "Alive? true"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c04-l02-x1",
   "prompt": "给 `Counter` 结构体（`value: i32`）添加方法 `increment`：把 `value` 加 1。调用三次并输出 `value`。",
   "starter": [
    "struct Counter:",
    "    value: i32",
    "",
    "impl Counter:",
    "    fn increment(self: lend Counter):",
    "        pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    c = Counter{ value: 0 }",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    print(c.value)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "struct Counter:",
    "    value: i32",
    "",
    "impl Counter:",
    "    fn increment(self: lend Counter):",
    "        self.value += 1",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    c = Counter{ value: 0 }",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    c.increment()",
    "    print(c.value)"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `pass` 换成 `self.value += 1`。",
   "expected": [
    "3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c04-l02-q1",
   "q": "没有 `self` 的方法叫什么？",
   "options": [
    "私有方法",
    "静态方法（常用作构造函数）",
    "损坏的方法"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "像 `Player.new(...)` 这样调用的方法是静态方法。"
  }
 ]
